## Versatile development workflow

Use the `versatile-dev` skill for non-trivial engineering work that benefits
from repository mapping, adaptive planning, bounded implementation, validation,
independent review, or review-fix loops. Keep requirements and final acceptance
in the main task, parallelize read-heavy work, and keep one writer for overlapping
code. Follow this repository's own build, test, security, API/ABI, numerical, and
performance rules over generic workflow defaults.
